---
import { bootstrapDemoPlan, PROGRAM_LABEL } from "../lib/db";
import { DEMO_SLUG } from "../lib/plans";
import { ACADEMIC_YEARS, DEFAULT_ACADEMIC_YEAR } from "../lib/seed-types";
import "../styles.css";

await bootstrapDemoPlan();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-AU">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Fine Print — ANU study planning that tells you now</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a href="/" class="site-title">Fine Print</a>
      <nav aria-label="site" class="site-nav">
        <a href="/" aria-current="page">Plan</a>
        <a href={`/plan/${DEMO_SLUG}`}>Example</a>
        <a href="/readme/">About</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main>
      <h1>Study planner</h1>
      <div class="intro-box">
        <p>
          Programs and Courses knows whether you may enrol in a course. ISIS
          knows whether your plan will graduate you. Both tell you after you
          have decided. This is the same data, at the moment it is useful.
        </p>
        <p>
          Plans are for the {PROGRAM_LABEL}. There is no login: the plan's
          address is the only way back into it, so keep the link.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p id="commencementYearHint">
        ANU holds you to the program requirements of the Academic Year you
        commenced, not the current one — pick the year your plan should
        follow.
      </p>
      <form method="post" action="/api/plans">
        <label for="commencementYear">Commencement year</label>
        <select
          id="commencementYear"
          name="commencementYear"
          aria-describedby="commencementYearHint"
        >
          {
            ACADEMIC_YEARS.map((year) => (
              <option value={year} selected={year === DEFAULT_ACADEMIC_YEAR}>
                {year}
              </option>
            ))
          }
        </select>
        <button>Start a plan</button>
      </form>
      <p>
        Or open the{" "}
        <a href={`/plan/${DEMO_SLUG}`}>example plan</a> to see what a blocked
        course looks like.
      </p>
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer">Fine Print — not affiliated with ANU</footer>
  </body>
</html>
